- [Claude (Anthropic)](https://claude.ai/) - AI assistant focused on helpful and harmless conversations.
- [YouChat (You.com)](https://you.com/) - AI chat integrated within the You.com search engine.
- [Pi (Inflection AI)](https://pi.ai/) - An AI companion designed to be supportive and informative.
